OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDamp
OL,6,Fand cloudy day on Saturday with mist
OL,7,Fand fog lingering. Remaining cloudy
OL,8,Fwith light rain overnight into Sunday.
OL,9,FDry and partly cloudy into Monday.
OL,10,FLight winds. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
